{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lumina Chronos 是一款以發光圓環呈現倒數的番茄鐘，適合學習、編程、寫作或創作時使用；它結合柔和色彩轉換、漂浮粒子與玻璃質感卡片，營造平靜專注的工作空間。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-46.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>視覺化專注循環</h2>\n<p>專注時以發光圓環倒數，顏色由綠轉黃至紅，完成短休後自動接續，整組結束進入長休。可調整工作與休息時長、每組 1 至 8 回合，開關音效與觸覺回饋，休息時顯示名人語錄。支援 iPhone 與 iPad 直向及橫向，無廣告、無追蹤、毋須帳戶，離線可用，並以本地通知提醒。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-39-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-40-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Lumina Chronos</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lumina-chronos/id6779196533?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:22:35.950862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:09:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:18:40.588290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:20.460637+00:00","content_hash":"196893c011e207a196a7363d503299bbb68466807634f355aaefb221393a47f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}